title: "risk-lab: One-day VaR and CVaR for a three-asset portfolio"
abstract: >-
  One-day Value at Risk and Conditional Value at Risk for a fixed
  three-asset portfolio of SPY, TLT and GLD, with a walk-forward backtest,
  Kupiec and Christoffersen coverage tests, and a reproducible data snapshot.
